        "id": 67, "label": "Disassembly — Steps",
        "steps": [
          "1. Secure vehicle — pull MSD (driver side underfloor). Wait 5 min.",
          "2. Verify HV de-energised with voltmeter (<60V).",
          "3. Remove underbody protection (10x M8 bolts, Torx T40).",
          "4. Disconnect coolant lines (front left), HV cables (orange), LV connectors (4x BMS).",
          "5. Position battery lifting device (Volvo Tool 9818780).",
          "6. Loosen 24x M12 mounting bolts (90 Nm). Lower battery (~625 kg).",
          "7. Remove housing cover (32x M6 bolts). Disconnect busbars. Remove modules (4x M8 each)."
        ],
        "status": "MOCK", "access_level": 2,
